OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing to the southeast after dawn.
OL,7,FThen mostly dry with bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells breaking through and just the
OL,9,Fodd shower possible in the west. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay dry through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight. Variable cloud
OL,14,Fwith clear spells, especially in the
OL,15,Feast, leading to a chillier night than
OL,16,Fof late.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,19,Fthe day and staying mostly dry, though
OL,20,Fthe odd shower is possible during late
OL,21,Fafternoon into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
